§§ `O que devo apresentar`

-- Art. 80, § 1: the request is instructed with the judicial certificate of the imprisonment and proof of the continued imprisonment is presented to keep the benefit; § 5: electronic access to the database of the CNJ may replace both. arguments: requer (or recebe), o INSS tem acesso à base do CNJ.
