§§ `Os programas e regimes extintos`

-- Arts. 137 and 138: a benefit of the Programa dos Estudantes or of an extinct regime granted up to the entry into force (25 July 1991, that day included) is kept, never under the salário mínimo; the time of contribution of those who contributed regularly counts for the RGPS.
